# Trivy vulnerability ignore list.
#
# Every entry below must carry: the CVE id, a one-line justification, an owner,
# and a review/expiry date. An entry past its expiry date should be treated as
# a build failure waiting to happen — re-run Trivy and either fix or renew it.
#
# No entries yet. Keep this file's header even when empty so the first real
# acceptance has a format to follow, e.g.:
#
# CVE-2024-XXXXX
# # Justification: fixed only in a major bump of <lib> that breaks <feature>;
# # tracked upstream at <issue link>. No known exploit path in our usage
# # (we don't call the affected code path).
# # Owner: babitha.bollu@gmail.com
# # Review-by: 2026-12-31
